! mcp_bootstrap_p391.strap -- MCP printed page 391: the END-OF-JOB
! overlay (PUNID 22$EOJ, card series ZA), "SERVICE ROUTINES FOR ERROR
! MESSAGES, ETC.": W REJJB, Y TRT/Y TRMOV, W J4VV, W SYSC2/W SYSC1/
! W SYSCA, Z JOBC1, W JC4QJ, W JC4QT, W JC4QL.  Lines 1-56.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.141, read at 400 dpi, doubtful glyphs
! at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 22$EOJ  CARD
! ID ZA000447  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 391"; the heading row's
! LOCATION field prints no value.
!
! >>> THIS PAGE IS NOT SCOMD. <<<  PUNID 22$EOJ (not 22SCOMD), card
! series ZA (not WA), and line 4 opens at 020372.40 -- low core, a new
! overlay origin, far from SCOMD's 2344xx-2354xx.  Every non-resident
! symbol below is an $EOJ symbol; none is copied from a SCOMD, LOADER
! or $DUMP deck.  Resident symbols (pp.99-319) are shared.
!
! tools/page_sheet.py 391 failed its line fit (no LINE column read), so
! the sheet gave no reading: everything below is off the image.
!
! THE PAGE.  56 lines, every line number prints a "*".  Lines 1-3 are
! the banner remark.  Located rows run contiguous from 020372.40 to
! 020431.00 (a half-word B; next location 020431.40), then blank paper.
! "*" after the LOCATION on lines 5, 22 and 44.
!   lines 25-28, 34-36, 39, 42, 45-46: null-op data words (",SCOMD" ...),
!             the parameter words after BD,SPRIME / B,DMCP.
!   line 13   YTRMOV XW,0,0,1,0 prints 000000.00+ 000 000000 000001.
! JOIN.  p.390 is not landed; contiguity backwards is NOT established.
! p.268 (resident) independently stands YTRT in at 020375.40 (its WREJRT
! SYN,YTRT+.32 prints 020376.00): this page's line 10 label, a witness.
! p.392 should open at 020431.40 with serial about ZA000498.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 25 ",SCCMD" = SCOMD (landed p.106 SCOMD SYN,80.0; prints
!     000120.00).  Lines 34, 44 ",DCCMM" = DCOMM (landed p.105 SYN,35.32;
!     prints 000043.40).
!   * line 48 "BB,SYSMCD,WRESTR" = SYSMOD (landed p.103 SYN(BU,2),
!     SCOMRG+.8; prints 215001.10).
!   * line 13 label prints "YTRMCV" (open); line 11 LVI,$15,YTRMOV prints
!     the O closed at 400 dpi, and LVI's value 020400 is this row.
!   * lines 31, 37 ZJOBC1: the round after J is closed at 900 dpi (O);
!     no other deck spells it.
!   * line 35 ",YJ1FUL": the third glyph is ambiguous I/1 on the ink;
!     C22-6728 spells YJ1FUL (and the resident sibling is SJ1FUL, line 31).
!   * line 45 YJCEM: C, as C22-6728 spells it and as the CEM family
!     (YTCEM, YLCEM, YICEM on p.268) is spelled.
!   * WJCV, WSYSC2, WJC4Q, TMOVE, WREJJB as C22-6728 spells them.
!   * lines 29 (NOP) and 40 (BE,$+.32) print the last hex byte "C0";
!     neither statement can make a C there (no index), and line 53's BE
!     prints 00: the open round is 0 -- 00 (line 21 BZAE's C0 is real).
!   * octal fields printing "C" for 0 (lines 6, 12, 13, 16, ...) are 0.
!
! EXTERNALS.  $EOJ symbols defined on pages not landed (WRESTR, WJCV,
! WJC4Q, YJ1FUL, YJCEM, YTCEM, YLCEM) come from this page's binary,
! half word only; TMOVE (resident, not landed in the body; the IPL copy
! is at 005014) likewise.  YTCEM/YLCEM agree with p.268's stand-ins.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  ZA000447 .. ZA000497.  Lines 33-36 all print ZA000479;
! lines 51-52 both ZA000494; lines 55-56 both ZA000497.  Otherwise line
! N prints ZA000(446+N) through line 33, ZA000(443+N) for lines 37-51,
! ZA000(442+N) for 53-55.  Recorded, not explained.

